:2902aa9e-1950-4330-b837-b2273c39ec3b\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Clotilde\" title=\"Clotilde\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/da/Portrait_Clotilde.png/25px-Portrait_Clotilde.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/da/Portrait_Clotilde.png/38px-Portrait_Clotilde.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/da/Portrait_Clotilde.png/50px-Portrait_Clotilde.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Reaper of Bhaal Clotilde\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/da/Portrait_Clotilde.png/25px-Portrait_Clotilde.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/da/Portrait_Clotilde.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Clotilde\" title=\"Clotilde\">Reaper of Bhaal Clotilde</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>O Devotees of Untimely Death! \n</p><p><br>\nIt's time to skin, to flay, to make our presence felt! The terror must not wane. \n</p><p><br>\nThose arrogant adventurers - make a bloody example of them! Tear them to gobbets! I will ensure that the hapless <a href=\"/wiki/Flaming_Fist\" title=\"Flaming Fist\">Fists</a> stay out of it. \n</p><p><br>\nAnd if any bystanders suffer unintended maiming or death, well - that's simply more offerings to all-mighty <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal\" title=\"Bhaal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Bhaal_Icon.webp/20px-Bhaal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Bhaal_Icon.webp/29px-Bhaal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Bhaal_Icon.webp/39px-Bhaal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bhaal\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Bhaal_Icon.webp/20px-Bhaal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Bhaal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal\" title=\"Bhaal\">Bhaal</a>! \n</p><p><br>\nO.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714215001\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.056 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.058 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2094/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32262/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8391/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 4/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931832/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   45.555      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   45.555      1 -total\n 57.67%   26.271      9 Template:Icon_text\n 50.51%   23.008     21 Template:Trim\n 20.49%    9.334      2 Template:Uid\n 18.43%    8.394      4 Template:Icon_link\n 13.76%    6.267      1 Template:Main_only\n 12.04%    5.483      2 Template:Template_style\n 11.04%    5.030      9 Template:Ifempty\n  9.78%    4.454      2 Template:CharLink\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12720-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714215001 and revision id 365759. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}